          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઝાપટું (jhāpṭũ) goes back to jhapp, \"a sudden movement\", a form CDIAL reconstructs; CDIAL lists the Gujarati word, \"a sharp shower of rain\" (CDIAL 5336)."
            }
